@startuml
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as user
participant "React SPA\n(Client)" as ui
participant "API Gateway\n(Security Enforcement)" as gw #LightCyan
participant "Account Service\n(Protected Resource)" as acc #LightGreen
participant "Fraud Service\n(Risk Engine)" as fraud #LightPink
participant "Auth Service\n(Identity & 2FA)" as auth #LightGreen

== Phase 1: Initial Request & Denial ==

user -> ui : Initiate Large Transfer
ui -> gw : POST /api/accounts/transfer\n[Authorization: Bearer <JWT>]
gw -> acc : Forward Request

acc -> fraud : POST /internal/fraud/evaluate
fraud --> acc : Decision: **STEP_UP**\n(High Risk Score)

acc --> gw : 428 Precondition Required\n{"error": "TOTP_REQUIRED"}
gw --> ui : 428 Precondition Required

== Phase 2: Challenge & Step-Up (2FA) ==

ui --> user : Prompt for Google Authenticator Code
user -> ui : Inputs 6-digit code (e.g. 123456)

ui -> gw : POST /api/accounts/transfer\n[Authorization: Bearer <JWT>]\n**[X-TOTP-Code: 123456]**

note over gw
  API Gateway intercepts the X-TOTP-Code
  and delegates validation to Auth Service
  before allowing the request through.
end note

gw -> auth : GET /internal/auth/verify-totp?code=123456
auth --> gw : 200 OK (Code is Valid)

== Phase 3: Execution ==

gw -> acc : Forward Request\n(2FA Verified)
acc -> fraud : POST /internal/fraud/evaluate
note right of fraud
  Fraud Service acknowledges
  2FA was successfully completed.
end note
fraud --> acc : Decision: **ALLOW**

acc -> acc : Execute Transfer...
acc --> gw : 201 Created
gw --> ui : Transfer Successful
ui --> user : Display Success Screen

@enduml
